<p>Sound in Dragon Age is packaged using a program called <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/FMOD" title="FMOD">FMOD</a>. FMOD sound banks include the audio waveform itself, and can also include settings determining how the sound is played.
</p>
